  "prompt": "# Core Summary\nA professional golfer <ID_A> executes a powerful full swing on a sunlit tee box, captured in a single continuous vertical shot. The clip opens with the apex of the backswing, accelerates through a crisp impact that sends grass debris flying, and ends with the camera tilting up to track the ball's clear parabolic trajectory against a blue sky.\n\n# Scene\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nOutdoor golf course tee box under bright midday sunlight. Lush, manicured green grass fills the lower third of the frame, with a clear, deep blue sky occupying the upper two-thirds. Distant tree lines blur softly in the background. Lighting is high-contrast with sharp shadows cast by the golfer, emphasizing the texture of the turf.\n**Audio Description**: Ambient breeze rustling grass, building to a sharp club whoosh and a solid impact thud.\n\n# Subjects Description\n<ID_A>:\n- *Gender*: Male.\n- *Race/Ethnicity*: East Asian.\n- *Age*: Young adult.\n- *Appearance features*: Athletic build, wearing a fitted white polo shirt, dark charcoal slacks, white visor cap, and a white golf glove on the left hand. Holding a driver golf club.\n- *Vocal Characteristics*: N/A (No dialogue).\n\n# Dynamic Narrative\n[shot1][00:00-00:05]\nThe camera holds a low-angle medium full shot, framing <ID_A> centrally with the sky above for vertical clearance. <ID_A> stands in a professional address stance, knees slightly bent, eyes locked on the ball teed low on the grass.\n**00:00-00:01**: <ID_A> reaches the apex of the backswing, body coiled tightly, club head high against the sky.\n**00:01-00:02**: Rapid downswing begins; hips rotate aggressively toward the target, transferring weight to the front foot. The club accelerates downward with visible blur.\n**00:02-00:03**: **Impact**. The clubface strikes the ball squarely. A burst of fine green grass debris and dirt particles explodes forward from the contact point, catching the sunlight. The ball launches instantly.\n**00:03-00:05**: <ID_A> completes a balanced follow-through, chest facing the target, holding the pose. The camera tilts up smoothly, following the white ball as it ascends in a high, clear parabola against the blue sky, shrinking into the distance.\n**Sound Design**: A sharp *whoosh* of air during the downswing syncs with the visual acceleration, followed by a crisp *crack* at impact, fading into ambient wind as the ball flies.\n\n# Style, Color & Aesthetics\n- **Visual Style**: High-definition sports cinematography, crisp and clean.\n- **Color Palette**: Vibrant emerald greens of the grass, deep azure blue of the sky, stark white of the ball and shirt, high contrast.\n- **Lighting**: Hard directional sunlight creating defined shadows and specular highlights on the club head and debris particles.\n- **Texture**: Sharp focus on the golfer and debris, slight motion blur on the club during swing speed, shallow depth of field on the background trees.\n\n# Atmosphere & Emotion\n- **Atmosphere**: Focused, energetic, and precise.\n- **Emotion**: Anticipation building to satisfaction; the visceral power of a perfect strike.",
